ly encouraging! You have got to be proud of yourself.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, I am. And he did say that he might want to renovate the restaurant and he put me in charge of that.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Congratulations! You seem to be great at that!"}, {"time": "48000", "image": "engenn8le18ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, I think I will. But I'd like to bounce some decorating ideas off of you before I take the plunge and order new furniture and paint!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course! You don't want to make any hasty decisions about decorating. That could be very costly. You have to weigh your options very carefully.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm optimistic! It's going to be like working in a brand new restaurant!"}]}}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}